<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
 my $R2 =  qq{ SELECT * FROM `test` WHERE `string`=?};
 my $sR2 = $dbh-&gt;prepare($R2);
 my $row2 = $sR2-&gt;execute();
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You forgot to pass &lt;c&gt;$string&lt;/c&gt; to &lt;c&gt;-&gt;execute&lt;/c&gt; as a value for the placeholder. &lt;c&gt;$sR2-&gt;execute($string);&lt;/c&gt; works as expected.&lt;/p&gt;
